        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9dc31c27-ddc8-5baf-81d6-b5f2807b4adf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Songs: \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\", \"Style\"\n- Films: \"Gentleman\", \"Punjabi House\", \"Chup Chup Ke\", \"Khatta Meetha\"\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer, score composer\n\nFacts:\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" is a Tamil song featured in the 1993 Tamil film \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters is noted for songs including \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- In the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\", Suresh Peters composed the songs in his debut as a film composer, while S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.\n- The film \"Chup Chup Ke\" was originally titled \"Khatta Meetha\".\n- The story of \"Chup Chup Ke\" was adapted from the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\".\n- \"Chup Chup Ke\" had the tagline \"Love meets confusion meets love.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7f54e369-db83-52fc-8416-15c1a095da45",
